{"id": "86243", "name": "Find the expression of the tangent line", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Consider the function \\({\\displaystyle f(x) = {{CT:0}}}\\) whose graph is displayed below.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The tangent line through the point \\(({{CT:1}}, {{CT:2}})\\) is also a function. Determine its expression.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">You can use the GeoGebra applet below to move the secant line into a tangent line by moving the points A and B. There are other ways to solve this problem.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">What is the slope of the tangent line at the pont \\(({{CT:1}}, {{CT:2}})\\)?</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> By slope we mean the ratio of the \\(y\\)- and \\(x\\)-coordinate changes of the line.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> Answer: [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:ans1]]</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">At which point does the tangent line cross the \\(y\\)-axis?</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> Give only the value of the \\(y\\)-coordinate.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> Answer: [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]][[feedback:ans2]]</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Formulate the expression of the tangent line by using the formula \\(g(x) = kx + b\\), where \\(k\\) is the slope and \\(b\\) is the point where the line crosses the \\(y\\)-axis.</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> Answer: Tangent line's function is \\(g(x)\\) = [[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]][[feedback:ans3]].</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><applet codebase=\"http://www.geogebra.org/webstart/3.2/unsigned/\" archive=\"geogebra.jar\" code=\"geogebra.GeoGebraApplet\" name=\"ggbApplet\" width=\"585\" height=\"508\"><param name=\"ggbBase64\" value=\"\" /><param name=\"image\" value=\"http://www.geogebra.org/webstart/loading.gif\" /><param name=\"boxborder\" value=\"false\" /><param name=\"centerimage\" value=\"true\" /><param name=\"java_arguments\" value=\"-Xmx512m -Djnlp.packEnabled=true\" /><param name=\"cache_archive\" value=\"geogebra.jar, geogebra_main.jar, geogebra_gui.jar, geogebra_cas.jar, geogebra_export.jar, geogebra_properties.jar\" /><param name=\"cache_version\" value=\"3.2.47.0, 3.2.47.0, 3.2.47.0, 3.2.47.0, 3.2.47.0, 3.2.47.0\" /><param name=\"framePossible\" value=\"false\" /><param name=\"showResetIcon\" value=\"false\" /><param name=\"showAnimationButton\" value=\"true\" /><param name=\"enableRightClick\" value=\"false\" /><param name=\"errorDialogsActive\" value=\"true\" /><param name=\"enableLabelDrags\" value=\"false\" /><param name=\"showMenuBar\" value=\"false\" /><param name=\"showToolBar\" value=\"false\" /><param name=\"showToolBarHelp\" value=\"false\" /><param name=\"showAlgebraInput\" value=\"false\" /><param name=\"allowRescaling\" value=\"true\" />This is a Java Applet created using GeoGebra from www.geogebra.org - it looks like you don't have Java installed, please go to www.java.com </applet></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">\n<script type=\"text/javascript\">// <![CDATA[\nvar a0 = new String(\"{{CT:3}}\");\na0 = a0.replace(/\\$/g,''); //\\(\\$ \\)\nvar b0 = new String(\"{{CT:4}}\");\nb0 = b0.replace(/\\$/g,''); //\\(\\$ \\)\nvar c0 = new String(\"{{CT:5}}\");\nc0 = c0.replace(/\\$/g,''); //\\(\\$ \\)\nvar d0 = new String(\"{{CT:6}}\");\nd0 = d0.replace(/\\$/g,''); //\\(\\$ \\)\n\n// remove dollars from CAS output and pass the variables to GeoGebra\n\napplet = document.ggbApplet;\napplet.evalCommand(\"a=\"+a0);\napplet.evalCommand(\"b=\"+b0);\napplet.evalCommand(\"c=\"+c0);\napplet.evalCommand(\"d=\"+d0);\n// ]]></script>\n</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><em>This web page requires Java and it does not work in Google Chrome browser (version 13).</em></span></p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>Reading from the applet we see that the slope of the tangent line is {{CT:7}}.<br /> The tangent line crosses the \\(y\\)-axis at the point {{CT:8}}.<br /> Hence, its function on \\(x\\) is \\(g(x) = {{CT:9}}\\).</p>", "specificfeedback": "", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Vastauksesi on oikein.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Vastauksesi on osittain oikein.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Vastauksesi on väärin.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "ans1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "slope", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ans1-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ans1-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "ans2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "y2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": fa